{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">2000 AMC 12 #11</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">2000 AMC 10 #15</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two non-zero real numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b1d6265e67657b5886ce257671d45ff9c0282eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"12\" height=\"16\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81c68ece6edfa514c4b17206f7e386a48d9ecc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = a - b$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" />. Which of the following is a possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/8/2184ba0934b06a36bf8aae9c129820de02f9e8dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {a}{b} + \\frac {b}{a} - ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"37\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12caa6eae02771558ac049f1511ad5df90d99c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ - 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\ \\frac { -1 }{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\ \\frac {1}{3} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\ \\frac {1}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"399\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b605af1bc3e444eb9382367ae845cc23e146703.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {a}{b} + \\frac {b}{a} - ab = \\frac{a^2 + b^2}{ab} - (a - b) = \\frac{a^2 + b^2}{a-b} - \\frac{(a-b)^2}{(a-b)} = \\frac{2ab}{a-b} = \\frac{2(a-b)}{a-b} =\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"656\" height=\"45\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> to both sides of the equation relating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4bc8c36bb3082eed348c786ac38eab75f775ea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + b = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906cd70a52579fe88a9f9f0fcf95a084620a021d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(a+1) = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\" /> and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffd044098d9715794063eae8d0ae9c75d82bcd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{a}{a+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"79\" height=\"36\" />.  \n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c777bfee949c76ed20d6706622613798270575a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\frac{a}{a+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"79\" height=\"36\" /> into the desired expression yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a3252bc5dffb4d21a72534de5771fd4b91e2221c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{\\frac{a}{a+1}} + \\frac{\\frac{a}{a+1}}{a} - a \\cdot{\\frac{a}{a+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"178\" height=\"49\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccb1010580670e269645598ed8a0f331596eaa2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= a+1+\\frac{1}{a+1}-\\frac{a^2}{a+1} = a+1+\\frac{1-a^2}{a+1} = a+1+\\frac{(1-a)(1+a)}{1+a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"537\" height=\"42\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/481a14e2a319c025f9ba70809caa55777e76ff5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=a+1+1-a=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"203\" height=\"30\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d452eed72c81ea394b2dcbb8f0eff743734a7be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+b-a=0 \\Rightarrow (a+1)(b-1) = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"295\" height=\"18\" />. The two integer solutions to this are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95882ef79b538a727f5eb550c3a9810a7b28674.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. The problem states than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are non-zero, so we consider the case of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95882ef79b538a727f5eb550c3a9810a7b28674.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />. So, we end up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/6/716044a94055ecfd51c115bb1153d0fa59179521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2}{2} + \\frac{2}{-2} - 2 \\cdot -2 = 4 - 1 - 1 = 2 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"325\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just realize that two such numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/d/aed7daf83b15f4b045ce4c2650b8bed99217ad2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" />. You can see this by plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and then solving for b. With this, you can solve and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b37c1ba7b2790a5ccf75ea3b8bf5aadba9d2b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to some nonzero number. In this case, I'll set it to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Then solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/c/a5c3074350cb0aae32e9bd2ab04fb2156406b719.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=0.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Now just simply evaluate. In this case it's 2. So since 2 is a possible value of the original expression, select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/178ef194114ba60dbdd5dbe9675be6944851ad6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{a}{b}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782e5c4645efe985a17dafbc502fd409443fb3dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1-\\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"39\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c82db8e4687e61a1b7250e28b98447e3984e801d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}=1+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/c/d0cd2b8d4746149cadb247dbf8079b957a32eaa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}{a}=1-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67a0ed63a8178213211af00dab581883051525c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}+\\frac{b}{a}-ab=(1+a)+(1-b)-(a-b)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"355\" height=\"39\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7\">Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are told <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d553f9de433f345b78aabd2aee30dfc3792074c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=a-b$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8b7c8bc5f66e599906c5c6728f6f5c8cd744a15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1 - \\frac{b}{a} \\Rightarrow \\boxed{ \\frac{b}{a} = 1 - b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"195\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p><p>We can also solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" /> by dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Dividing, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca88e192a2271507ab27ea8c62079015767f5396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{a}{b} - 1 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{ \\frac{a}{b} = a + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"199\" height=\"46\" />. \n</p><p>Plugging these values into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/8403129a5f6981b6c087fdfacf295265f6b5db61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} + \\frac{b}{a} - ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845db0ecba7e38ef4b0b2f4c4d3dce2427ba2a0e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a + 1) + (1 - b) - (a - b) = 2\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d1302e73ece29d10218238af739577904f6f00a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>-Dustin_Links\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/G4c2oCtupTg?si=kq64-TkH7r_N3mLV&amp;t=148\">https://youtu.be/G4c2oCtupTg?si=kq64-TkH7r_N3mLV&amp;t=148</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-RloNHTnXM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-RloNHTnXM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZWqHxc0i7ro?t=6\">https://youtu.be/ZWqHxc0i7ro?t=6</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8nxvuv5oZ7A&amp;t=3s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8nxvuv5oZ7A&amp;t=3s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Q_th4G-xGLo?si=4VwtJirZjREyyQuO\">https://youtu.be/Q_th4G-xGLo?si=4VwtJirZjREyyQuO</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody